CESelfRegister=MSCECommandBar.dll,MSCEComDlg.dll,MSCEFile.dll,MSCEImageList.dll,MSCEListView.dll,vbscript.dll,pvbhost2.dll,pvbform2.dll,pvbdecl.dll

[CEDevice.SH 3 (1K) v2.10]
